{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/BrianCChao/status/2056769260765254104","id":"2056769260765254104","text":"The idea of \"diffusion is spectral autoregression\" is well-established, and while it has shaped scheduler designs, no one has fully exploited it for generation efficiency — prior cascaded approaches only scratch the surface.\n\nOur new work, Spectral Progressive Diffusion, progressively grows resolution along a single denoising trajectory for training-free acceleration and fine-tuning for further gains — NO cascades, NO separate models, NO pre-training. Frequency and resolution are two sides of the same coin!","raw_text":{"text":"The idea of \"diffusion is spectral autoregression\" is well-established, and while it has shaped scheduler designs, no one has fully exploited it for generation efficiency — prior cascaded approaches only scratch the surface.\n\nOur new work, Spectral Progressive Diffusion, progressively grows resolution along a single denoising trajectory for training-free acceleration and fine-tuning for further gains — NO cascades, NO separate models, NO pre-training. Frequency and resolution are two sides of the same coin!","display_text_range":[0,512],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[240,270]}]},"author":{"screen_name":"BrianCChao","url":"https://x.com/BrianCChao","id":"1426168059832635393","followers":700,"following":475,"likes":695,"media_count":30,"name":"Brian Chao","description":"Ph.D. student @Stanford · @NSF Graduate Fellow","raw_description":{"text":"Ph.D. student @Stanford · @NSF Graduate Fellow","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2009449635450863617/8b3Y1zMZ_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Aug 13 13:05:51 +0000 2021","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://bchao1.github.io","display_url":"bchao1.github.io"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":6,"retweets":8,"likes":122,"bookmarks":93,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Tue May 19 16:09:39 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1779206979,"views":11254,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/GordonWetzstein/status/2056766835283067065","id":"2056766835283067065","text":"High-fidelity generation is hitting a scaling crisis as DiT compute grows with image resolution and video length. But do we need high-resolution denoising at every step?\n\nWe introduce Spectral Progressive Diffusion, a plug-and-play framework for efficient image and video generation that directly exploits the spectral autoregression property of diffusion to grow resolution during denoising.\n[1/7]","raw_text":{"text":"High-fidelity generation is hitting a scaling crisis as DiT compute grows with image resolution and video length. But do we need high-resolution denoising at every step?\n\nWe introduce Spectral Progressive Diffusion, a plug-and-play framework for efficient image and video generation that directly exploits the spectral autoregression property of diffusion to grow resolution during denoising.\n[1/7]","display_text_range":[0,398],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[272,295],"id":"2056763304035688448","display":"pic.x.com/jxY6NUl8Tp","original":"https://t.co/jxY6NUl8Tp","replacement":"https://x.com/GordonWetzstein/status/2056766835283067065/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"GordonWetzstein","url":"https://x.com/GordonWetzstein","id":"107572196","followers":5450,"following":51,"likes":164,"media_count":100,"name":"Gordon Wetzstein","description":"Professor at Stanford University & Co-founder at Rhoda AI","raw_description":{"text":"Professor at Stanford University & Co-founder at Rhoda AI","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/107572196/1773120012","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/527589449333350400/9X4rkIg4_200x200.jpeg","joined":"Sat Jan 23 01:08:51 +0000 2010","protected":false,"website"